      "title": "GPIL: New Integrated Plant And Logistics Expansion Will Support Steady Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have maintained their price target for Godawari Power & Ispat at ₹275, with the steady fair value and slightly revised discount rate and future P/E assumptions reflecting a largely unchanged view on the stock's risk and earnings profile. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled on May 19, 2026 to consider audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, audited financial statements for the same period, and a possible final dividend recommendation on equity shares for FY 2026 (company filing).",
