      "date": "2026-04-20T18:10:48.000Z",
      "title": "GPIL: New Integrated Plant And Logistics Shift Will Support Steady Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have maintained their price target for Godawari Power & Ispat at ₹275, citing largely unchanged assumptions on revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E, along with a marginally updated discount rate in their valuation work. What's in the News The board approved setting up an integrated steel plant at Sarora, Raipur, with planned capacity of 1.00 million tons per year of finished iron and steel products and an estimated project cost of ₹70,000 million, funded roughly equally by debt and internal accruals, alongside existing 0.5 million ton capacity at Siltara with reported utilisation above 95% (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
